      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786294826766,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. This is a coordination drawing, not a suppression design. The listed\nsystem's hydraulic calculation governs agent quantity, nozzle count and\nposition, and vent area. Require it as a named deliverable.",
      "originalText": "1. This is a coordination drawing, not a suppression design. The listed system's hydraulic calculation governs agent quantity, nozzle count and position, and vent area. Require it as a named deliverable.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 381,
      "versionNonce": 100994260,
      "index": "b3u",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e306",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1640.792196744686,
      "y": 433.4382785097142,
      "width": 513.3761617855763,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786294826766,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Door fan test to NFPA 2001 Annex C at acceptance and annually. Budget\na day to chase leaks and re-test - the first test almost never passes.",
      "originalText": "2. Door fan test to NFPA 2001 Annex C at acceptance and annually. Budget a day to chase leaks and re-test - the first test almost never passes.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 404,
      "versionNonce": 485773908,
      "index": "b3v",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e307",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1640.792196744686,
      "y": 469.4382785097142,
      "width": 509.1871057946713,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786294826766,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Re-seal every penetration after every move, add and change. A single\nunsealed 1-inch sleeve will fail a 10-minute hold time.",
      "originalText": "3. Re-seal every penetration after every move, add and change. A single unsealed 1-inch sleeve will fail a 10-minute hold time.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 365,
      "versionNonce": 1893656532,
      "index": "b3w",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e308",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1640.792196744686,
      "y": 504.4382785097142,
      "width": 530.0528181548723,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
